</code></pre>,"<p>_posicao1 is reaching '5' in Teste1() and asking for elementAt(5), which doesn't exist. Lists in Dart are zero-based, which means they start at 0. Your list has 5 elements: 0,1,2,3,4.  You could do a bounds check in Teste1():</p>

