<p>I am trying to fix that Error since 5 days now, but i can't find any solution for that problem.</p>,"<p>It seems you are trying to delete the database while opening it (i.e. during onCreate) which won't work because the database is already open at this point. You should move what you are currently doing in <code>_onCreate</code> before calling <code>openDatabase</code>.</p>

