        _correctAns = answerIndex;
        _selectedAns = selectedIndex;
        update();
      }
    }
</code></pre>,"<p>First, notice how you have X amounts of questions, but your GetX class only have 2 values to correctly identify and checked whether it's correct or not (_correctAns and _selectedAns). That means you are replacing the old values with the new ones, and all the previously tapped answers follow the new one. I suggest turning _correctAns and _selectedAns into a list.</p>

