</code></pre>,"<p>I figured it out. The problem was <em>GetMaterialApp.router</em>. When you choose to use this type of <em>MaterialApp</em>, you have to create <em>GetDelegate</em> manually. That's because, I could use <em>Get.rootDelegate.toNamed()</em> method. But I think this way is more expensive and more complex. So, I had to change 3 different things to make it work:</p>

