Declaring a variable with no initialiser in Flutter, with null safety<p>I'm trying to implement Firebase authentication into my app with Flutter and my coding worked fine initially, although since I have migrated the project to null safety the authentication no longer works. I think I have 'isolated' where that is.</p>
