</code></pre>
<p>And I think this is caused by the fact that I am now having to initialise the <code>email</code> variable in <code>updateWith</code>, and I am using an empty string. Therefore, even though I am typing in an email into the TextField, when I submit, it submits the empty string, so that Firebase tells me I haven't submitted an email. I have tried it instead using email as a nullable value, like so:</p>
