<p>My goal is to make all the data from the list appear on the widget,</p>
<p>May be I'm doing something wrong,</p>
<p>Thanks for helping !</p>,"<p>The problem with your code is that although <code>getTaches()</code> is an <code>async</code> function, you can't <code>await</code> it in <code>initState</code>, because <code>initState</code> can't be an async function. As a result your <code>ReorderableListView</code> will be built earlier than the data is returned and added to <code>listeTaches</code> in <code>getTaches()</code> function.</p>

