<p>So as I told earlier that I am able to start the timer but cannot cancel it (as it is <code>null</code>) and it keeps on running every 5 seconds. Below is the console output:</p>
<pre><code>Unhandled Exception: NoSuchMethodError: Class 'Future&lt;dynamic&gt;' has no instance method 'call'.
